## Truly dive into paradise

Our suite has a spacious layout with a sitting area, a fully equipped kitchenette with a Nespresso machine, and a comfortable king-size bed dressed in soft linen. The modern en-suite has both a walk-in shower and a bathtub, with Marie-Stella-Maris toiletries. Begin or end your day on your own private balcony and take in the view. Perfect for couples looking for something refined and intimate.
